                  }
                },
                "alt": "Rogers logo in white"
              }
            },
            {
              "_type": "eventQuote",
              "_key": "d3507019f698",
              "quote": "“The dinner was amazing! It was great connecting with various people in the industry and hearing different viewpoints. Excited to hopefully be considered for another one in the future. The possibilities at these dinners are endless!”",
              "name": "Matthew Kaddor",
              "logo": {
                "_type": "altImage",
                "asset": {
                  "_upload": {
                    "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c34f4c0ee3329913fc72eac/6883c331d3435e7cae4bb4b9_Gymshark-Logo-1.png",
                    "type": "image"
                  }
                },
                "alt": "Gymshark logo in white"
              }
            },
            {
              "_type": "eventQuote",
              "_key": "cd90ae3e9f9e",
              "quote": "\"I loved the evening and conversations. It’s rare to bring brands and creators to talk through topics that are more candid and without an agenda. No dealings, no negotiations. Just marketers and creators sharing stories. Love the concept!\"",
              "name": "Daniel Rabinovich",
